# What the release build must not be handed (BuildKit reads `<Dockerfile>.dockerignore` from
# beside the Dockerfile, since this one lives outside its context).
#
# `dist/` above all: `make release` empties only the directory of the version it is building, so
# a developer's own older release would be copied into the image and served beside the new one.
bin/
dist/
coverage.out
coverage.html
*.test
